sequenceDiagram
  actor Analyst
  participant API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Finance as Calculation module
  Analyst->>API: Build snapshot for a period
  API->>DB: Acquire publication guard
  API->>DB: Read canonical facts, mapping and quality
  API->>Finance: Calculate Decimal measures with pinned rates
  Finance-->>API: Measures, contributions and reconciliation
  API->>DB: Insert or reuse snapshot by manifest and result digest
  API-->>Analyst: Immutable snapshot and checksum
  Analyst->>API: Compare two saved snapshots
  API->>DB: Read frozen inputs and outputs
  API-->>Analyst: Changed versions, numerical and quality differences
